  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "nb_c",
      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -380
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Post-effects\n\nThe Effect node runs a GPU pass over a whole layer. Here four are chained: bloom makes the bright strokes glow, chromatic aberration splits red and blue towards the edges, film grain flickers on its own every frame, and a vignette darkens the corners.\n\nPick another `mode` on any of them (displace, dither, halftone \u2026): the pins follow the mode.",
        "width": 420,
        "height": 260
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "Post-effects\n\nThe Effect node runs a GPU pass over a whole layer. Here four are chained: bloom makes the bright strokes glow, chromatic aberration splits red and blue towards the edges, film grain flickers on its own every frame, and a vignette darkens the corners.\n\nPick another `mode` on any of them (displace, dither, halftone \u2026): the pins follow the mode.",
        "width": 420,
        "height": 260
      }
    },
